# ---- Database ----
# tickets.db is COMMITTED by default so a prebuilt, pre-embedded DB ships with
# the deploy (simplest Azure persistence). If you prefer to build it on the
# server with `python ingest_tickets.py`, uncomment the next line:
# tickets.db
tickets.db-journal
tickets.db-wal
tickets.db-shm
